flowchart TD
    RootCA["🏛️ Root CA\n(RSA 4096 / EC P-521\nML-DSA-87)"]
    IntCA1["🏢 Intermediate CA 1\n(RSA 3072 / EC P-384\nML-DSA-65)"]
    IntCA2["🏢 Intermediate CA 2\n(EC P-256 / ML-DSA-44)"]
    Leaf1["📄 TLS Leaf Cert\n(server.example.com)"]
    Leaf2["📧 S/MIME Cert\n(user@example.com)"]
    Leaf3["🔑 Code-Signing Cert\n(release-bot)"]

    RootCA --> IntCA1
    RootCA --> IntCA2
    IntCA1 --> Leaf1
    IntCA1 --> Leaf2
    IntCA2 --> Leaf3

    style RootCA fill:#1C1C1C,color:#fff,stroke:#444
    style IntCA1 fill:#2d2d2d,color:#fff,stroke:#555
    style IntCA2 fill:#2d2d2d,color:#fff,stroke:#555
